    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Illaya smiles warmly at you.>\r\n\r\nI am glad you returned to speak with me, child of the winds. I knew it the first moment you walked into my presence, that you were strong in the skysight. Do you find this surprising? Even those who have not trained as a Shaman may possess the gift. \r\n\r\nCome, let us speak about the mandate of the Windshapers, the nature of our struggles on Zephras, and the plight of our people.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Listen to Illaya",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Listen to what Illaya Amberwind has to say.",
      "title": "The Windshapers",
      "translationMetadata": {
